### 成功案例：完成上门服务单（SITEMENT类型，ACCEPTED状态）
POST http://119.3.163.139:8080/maintainers/2/serviceorders/24/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "errno": 0,
  "errmsg": "成功"
}

### 成功案例：完成上门服务单（SHIPMENT类型，SENT状态）
POST http://119.3.163.139:8080/maintainers/2/serviceorders/24/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "errno": 0,
  "errmsg": "成功"
}

### 失败案例1：服务单不存在
POST http://119.3.163.139:8080/maintainers/1001/serviceorders/9999/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "errno": 504,
  "errmsg": "资源不存在"
}

### 失败案例2：状态不允许（上门服务单处于WAITING状态）
POST http://119.3.163.139:8080/maintainers/1001/serviceorders/2002/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "errno": 507,
  "errmsg": "当前状态不允许此操作"
}

### 失败案例3：服务类型不支持（非SITEMENT/SHIPMENT类型）
POST http://119.3.163.139:8080/maintainers/1001/serviceorders/2003/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "errno": 801,
  "errmsg": "服务类型错误"
}